t_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["A camera locked onto a moving subject.\n\nThe trooper walks its clip and is carried around a turntable by Three Animate Transform\non 'per timeline', three units out from the middle. Without tracking it swings off the\nright of frame: measured over these 24 frames it sits 137 pixels off centre in a 512\npixel frame. With Three Track wired into the camera it stays within 26.\n\nThree Track finds the object already in the scene rather than building a second copy, so\nthe same Three Transform Object feeds both the group and the tracker. It reads the\nobject where it is at that moment, so anything animating it is followed.\n\nmode:\n  aim            turn to face it, camera stays where it is\n  follow         move with it, keep facing the same way\n  aim and follow both, which is a camera rigged to the subject\n\noffset_x/y/z place the camera relative to the object on 'follow'. aim_offset_y raises\nthe point it looks at, so 0.9 aims at the chest rather than the waist. damping lags the\ncamera behind, which smooths a jittery subject.\n\nNeeds stormtrooper.dae and Stormtrooper_D.jpg in ComfyUI's input folder, from the\nthree.js repository under examples/models/collada/stormtrooper/."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":14,"type":"WASThreeApp","pos":[1940,60],"size":[270,314],"flags":{},"order":17,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"scene","name":"scene","type":"THREE_SCENE","link":12},{"localized_name":"camera","name":"camera","type":"THREE_CAMERA","link":13},{"localized_name":"effects","name":"effects","shape":7,"type":"THREE_EFFECT","link":14},{"localized_name":"antialias","name":"antialias","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"antialias"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"shadows","name":"shadows","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"shadows"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"orbit_controls","name":"orbit_controls","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"orbit_controls"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"auto_rotate","name":"auto_rota